Solution
You can request an instance limit increase on a per-region basis. For more information, see Amazon
EC2 service quotas. Insuﬃcient instance capacity
Description
You get the InsufficientInstanceCapacity error when you try to launch a new instance or
restart a stopped instance. Cause
If you get this error when you try to launch an instance or restart a stopped instance, AWS does not
currently have enough available On-Demand capacity to fulﬁll your request. Solution
To resolve the issue, try the following:
• Wait a few minutes and then submit your request again; capacity can shift frequently. Instance limit exceeded 3586
